# Real capture bytes are NEVER committed (docs/DESIGN.md DM-01).
# This directory is the default local mount point for the real corpus asset
# store. Everything in it is ignored except this file, so an accidental
# `git add -A` after a collection session cannot put a garment photograph -
# potentially showing a collector's home - into a PUBLIC repository's
# permanent history.
*
!.gitignore
